  <item>
    <title>029：马年特辑·昭陵六骏：马年里的盛唐魂</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/699028e366e2c303776e2dc2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">699028e366e2c303776e2dc2</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 14 Feb 2026 08:05:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期播客以“昭陵六骏”为核心，通过生动叙事与史实梳理，系统讲述了这六匹战马作为唐太宗李世民生死战友的历史地位、艺术价值、流失经过及文化象征意义。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> 昭陵六骏：马年里的圣唐魂与流失的血泪见证</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="378">00:06:18</a> 昭陵六骏：唐太宗战马浮雕艺术的辉煌篇章</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="655">00:10:55</a> 白蹄乌</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="884">00:14:44</a> 特勒骠</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1074">00:17:54</a> 最爱的飒露紫</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1398">00:23:18</a> 青骓</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1556">00:25:56</a> 什伐赤</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1662">00:27:42</a> 拳毛騧，不拘一格将马才</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1929">00:32:09</a> 昭陵六郡石刻命运坎坷及流失</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2382">00:39:42</a> 历史记忆与马年团圆的呼唤</span><br><span>昭陵六骏的文创时刻</span><br><span></span><strong><span>昭陵六骏与冰峰</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvCXBAHfHpeUaicn-9bcxH-tjPBk.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>昭陵六骏与西安地铁</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl84oHb8Z3quTL8k-AIyP-fM7O8p.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>最爱的飒露紫</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuJAQwjO6fzQ7DnYlDEyGSJshDuj.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>还是好好看文物</span><br><span></span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lr6cnm_WGqGAuX30TpJpwUCPgKwv.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpoXYXzKKl4iec_d8ENNJYjGz2n4.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsDrT4nNpdCKAXHdI97K7q4phgpC.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpoXYXzKKl4iec_d8ENNJYjGz2n4.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>白蹄乌：倚天长剑，追风骏足；耸辔平陇，回鞍定蜀。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpPMz1fJKuu-TRsdU8qqGWr_w5yd.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lsessjWeBSOEbyd_UHSahty5jIxs.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>特勒骠：应策腾空，承声半汉；天险摧敌，乘危济难。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ls2uot9bXjKNbGY2mki6als3WnMZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrEldDTW_ORzyPGBH9PxanytKtjf.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>飒露紫：紫燕超跃，骨腾神骏，气詟三川，威凌八阵</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lluTagyjbTp-ZQM7G30qHIxvld2m.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/li8SOsbBjBho932mML-KMvT35KOA.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>青骓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrMwN0mBScNslLC1bfa7mJmLhpl3.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lm8lncjWAiYG1d85GIg1lvbNCTdj.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>什伐赤</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpknjdP41t4oTXODnTaCYCEHwCDu.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrfl_VGy9_2WWjIghZmyqEqpdpzB.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>拳毛騧</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnEN8b61kGyiSk5vRqQ17rTlyQPF.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lsmQU_8-GlEdiQt8hm7gS8XFEX8j.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>在这个马年，愿我们都能拥有昭陵六骏的精气神</span></p><span></span><p><span>愿你有</span><strong><span>“青骓”</span></strong><span>那股一往无前的冲劲，在职场的疆场上踏破荆棘；</span></p><span></span><p><span>愿你有</span><strong><span>“什伐赤”</span></strong><span>那份在逆境中依然昂首的坚韧，哪怕身中数箭，依然目光如炬；</span></p><span></span><p><span>愿你有</span><strong><span>“拳毛騧”</span></strong><span>这样化平凡为神奇的机遇，哪怕资质平平，也能在关键时刻爆发惊人的力量。</span></p><span></span><p><span>愿这六匹来自千年前的战马，能赐予你龙马精神，在新的一年里，</span><strong><span>奔腾不息，所向披靡！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><br><span></span><br><span></span><br><span></span><br><span></span><br><span></span><br><span></span><br><span></span><br><span></span><br><span></span><br><span></span><br><span></span><br><span></span><br><span></span><br><span></span><br><span></span><br><span></span></p>]]></description>
