  <item>
    <title>027：千年碑林·初唐双璧：褚遂良与欧阳询的楷书之道</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/697c54ca2fc7f49d0901b2c4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">697c54ca2fc7f49d0901b2c4</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 30 Jan 2026 06:59:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>西安碑林，肇始于北宋元祐二年（1087年），九百余载石墨相守，藏汉唐至明清碑石近三千方，被誉为“东方文化的宝库”“书法艺术的渊薮”。今以四章回望千年，从篆隶之变到楷草之魂，循石上文字，重听中华文明的呼吸。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期聚焦唐代楷书两大高峰：</span><strong><span>褚遂良与欧阳询</span></strong><span>。</span><br><span>通过《集王羲之书圣教序碑》、《雁塔圣教序》和《皇甫诞碑》，我们不仅能看到两位书法家独特的笔法与风格，更能体会到他们背后的故事与人格魅力。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>褚遂良</span></strong><span>：其字如美女婵娟，灵动秀美。《同州圣教序碑》展示了他在不同心境下的书写变化。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>欧阳询</span></strong><span>：他的字显瘦劲挺拔，结构险峻。《皇甫诞碑》不仅是学习欧体书法的重要范本，更是他一生坎坷经历的写照。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🔜 下期预告：</span><strong><span>颜真卿——从筋骨到血泪的大唐脊梁</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《怀仁集王书圣教序》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgRL6IfJ895WEFtUM3tU0VlEBBpN.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq-Njz8hsROz9BUu_BlESzQLzn-W.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsRDxAJBto2gluCO94HXaKGbfHzj.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fog5Y9caZY4cz1o7cjvVHggGVaP6.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>雁塔圣教序（原碑在西安大慈恩寺内）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiL6F4kEKDAt4X819FjgnXYB8bia.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv0NGy5xH8O3x2EEyNxmNs2YZd2R.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>同州三藏圣教序</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lryjA1x2J32YFvqWAkGThA23vb72.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lluFutZf9f8FVlyE_avlC34AZn7Q.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>同州圣教序VS雁塔圣教序</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpp8_8cC17jGrWR6nWxr71aCB9e0.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpe_zgE4yzTSmAr2nXpji-pLE6G1.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrU4kMgNaIVpo8lPCk-uBhQE8Ehf.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu94WziLfADyUPjLwOWzFRwz6nae.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqs88BllLMLailXq1gK0hbefx0R6.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frf5pBjOqkCHvNUb0qgrn63nZOy6.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>南北朝时期南北方的书风</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkXqpO-5t1hElg-xWse9vLwC1M92.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmEtMMTyub4b-1UvloWSPGiN_Dqb.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn82jdomYiOoWfI6IB7LgLMcJDHc.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>黄埔诞碑（唐 欧阳询）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ln1R4a6PfK2vf5NGnzOPTMHt3Uqp.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvrPmyeSERCcr5UATPkNPH2oQqzG.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>《九成宫醴泉铭》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FimhQnbUAwBJOV2Nv3R_13hg5MLM.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoHv7v0s4iIID_-466AKPMyYrGxd.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgy4mYAcEtwKw1juGQmZ1GsdEfYt.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>75岁的欧阳询遇见65岁的欧阳询</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl5hr2a9oePocHnWJnWEt9O4zP8p.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fttw2wgkOPpz-t93xZernqQsXLCD.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqtJZUOOe537qq2tLP8rvDQ_kpEU.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
