  <item>
    <title>019：国际志愿者日~困在学生时代的志愿服务&amp;那些没被标签的日常善意</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/692e80d74ef12f9fe973ee19</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">692e80d74ef12f9fe973ee19</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 Dec 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你记得最后一次志愿服务是什么时候吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>当善意需要证书证明时，我们失去了什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>为什么成年人的温暖总被系统性地忽视？</span></p><span></span><p><span>在中国，超过2.3亿注册志愿者中，职场人士参与率仅5%，形成鲜明的年龄断层。据《2023中国志愿服务发展报告》显示，18-24岁群体参与率42%，而25岁以上群体平均不足8%。这种落差背后是多重因素：86%的职场人困于时间成本，57%缺乏激励，43%面临组织障碍，更有70%因「彭宇案」式担忧而却步。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="44">00:44</a> 热血十二年：黑姐的志愿者日爱心传承</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="94">01:34</a> 志愿新探索：突破献血单一模式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="168">02:48</a> 代际鸿沟：学生撑起的志愿服务体系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="218">03:38</a> 科技赋能：信息化平台照亮救灾之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="318">05:18</a> 残酷对比：18-24岁42% vs 40+岁6%</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="370">06:10</a> 智能匹配：浦东实验创造的217%奇迹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="446">07:26</a> 法律困境：七成职场人被迫收起善意</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="575">09:35</a> 德国范式：志愿服务拉动23%就业率</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="618">10:18</a> 无声胜有声：流浪猫的冬日守护者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="721">12:01</a> 工具包温情：骑友两分钟的雷锋时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="925">15:25</a> 重新定义：将善意刻进生活本能</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="963">16:03</a> 温暖承诺：复刻每个听众的闪光点</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlmebD0kneu2V9bs4iiIVlo51vuH.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsHRFul7jKFd1i6fI4bEGYMHagjo.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtR8dWQ9BhyxqRzWW4rCJ6eC-JcA.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgCr1s7xWz1fspTxif3ljdMofuuB.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
